# Force HTTPS: instruct browsers to only ever connect over TLS (mirrors the
# marketing site). The HTTP→HTTPS redirect itself is the Cloudflare zone
# "Always Use HTTPS" setting.
#
# Content-Security-Policy (2026-10-12) — ENFORCED. What the app really reaches
# for, and nothing else:
#   • script-src: its own bundle and Google's sign-in script (the SDK loads
#     accounts.google.com/gsi/client on demand). No inline script, no
#     'unsafe-inline', no 'unsafe-eval', no WebAssembly (there is no ffmpeg).
#   • style-src 'unsafe-inline': React style attributes, everywhere.
#   • connect-src: the example video (same origin), Supabase (API, auth,
#     realtime), the suite changelog, Google sign-in.
#   • media-src / img-src blob:: every video and still the editor shows is an
#     object URL made from your own file on this device.
#   • worker-src 'self' blob:: the service worker and the timeline-strip worker.
#   • img-src https:: avatars and organisation logos (Supabase Storage, the
#     sign-in provider).
#   • No Cloudflare Web Analytics. Cloudflare's zone-level automatic setup
#     injects its beacon (static.cloudflareinsights.com) into the live HTML;
#     this policy refuses it. Turn the injection off for this host in
#     Cloudflare (Web Analytics site rules).
# The dev server (and so the e2e suite) serves the same policy Report-Only
# (vite.config.ts, cspDev()).
#
# Hardening. Nothing in the suite frames this app, so refusing to be framed
# elsewhere costs nothing and closes off click-jacking.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://accounts.google.com/gsi/style; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' data: blob: https://rygfxgalojojppxmhddo.supabase.co wss://rygfxgalojojppxmhddo.supabase.co https://changelog.unisim.co.uk https://accounts.google.com/gsi/; media-src 'self' blob: data:; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-src 'self' https://accounts.google.com/gsi/; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'
